Package: Rwards
Version: 0.1.0
Title: Reward Users for Discovering Bugs
Authors@R: c(
    person("Alexandre", "Fortier-Chouinard", role = "aut"),
    person("Mickael", "Temporão", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "m.temporao@sciencespobordeaux.fr"))
Description: Transforms the learning experience of a programming language by
    rewarding users for making mistakes. The goal is to take the anxiety out of
    error messages and make learning programming more engaging for newcomers.
    Users earn points for each error encountered, encouraging exploration and
    experimentation without fear of failure. Progress is cached across sessions.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: crayon, progress
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
License: GPL-3
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
